### Create a merchant
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchants
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_id": "merchant-1",
  "merchant_name": "Test Merchant"
}

### Create an authorization
POST {{baseUrl}}/authorizations
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
idempotency-key: create-auth-test-key

{
  "merchant_id": "merchant-1",
  "amount": 500
}


### Capture an auhtorization
POST {{baseUrl}}/authorizations/{{authorizationId}}/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
idempotency-key: capture-auth-test-key


### Void an auhtorization
POST {{baseUrl}}/authorizations/{{voidAuthorizationId}}/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
idempotency-key: void-auth-test-key